{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/GwOgQLDhHnuQA7xYKOsTNw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:00.031478+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/GwOgQLDhHnuQA7xYKOsTNw","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/gzfLiadSibdAYkx4laT47YW5OMyT3QCa8fgBkPZVuibjCcC3aOvHibq9klljsapsVXVpv68Ap9mxiamgB4cqe6gzAGw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>天津大学人文艺术学院 马球文化研究中心</span></strong><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/PWP4J9p458gToib2VygFg4icQ2jO4TRvyV2yayRwCGzMV7kzx0rGeqnzZR8JZQTlDORmNuOLT4wgAv1IaHNZlTAg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>天津大学人文艺术学院设有汉语言文学本科专业和中国语言文学一级学科硕士点（包括5个方向：语言学及应用语言学、汉语言文字学、中国古代文学、中国现当代文学、文艺学）。天津大学马球文化研究中心成立于2024年6月，中心教师具备硕士研究生导师资格，以马球历史文化、马球文献研究为主，并根据天津大学青年导师专项政策分配有招生名额1个，现面向全国招收2026级推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生（中国语言文学专业中国古代文学方向）。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/uicQI9FSdwVxBaPicuydruTYNlViaDLRRrbrhbU9qNAXZmQwzBTN71r8ZCtZak7maeBtGMDYRvib51IXf7oHicjrwJA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/PWP4J9p458gToib2VygFg4icQ2jO4TRvyV2yayRwCGzMV7kzx0rGeqnzZR8JZQTlDORmNuOLT4wgAv1IaHNZlTAg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>一、申请基本条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1.申请人应拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.申请人身体健康状况应符合教育部规定的体检标准；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.申请人必须是2026年普通高等学校应届本科毕业生，且本科期间学习成绩优秀，专业成绩或综合成绩名列本专业前茅；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.申请人须被推荐高校列入推免生名单；</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.申请人在本科阶段公开发表过学术论文，或取得科研成果，或在国内外重大竞赛中获奖，可优先考虑；</span></span></p><p><span><span>6.申请人在本科学习期间未受过任何影响录取的处罚或处分。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/uicQI9FSdwVxBaPicuydruTYNlViaDLRRrbrhbU9qNAXZmQwzBTN71r8ZCtZak7maeBtGMDYRvib51IXf7oHicjrwJA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/PWP4J9p458gToib2VygFg4icQ2jO4TRvyV2yayRwCGzMV7kzx0rGeqnzZR8JZQTlDORmNuOLT4wgAv1IaHNZlTAg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>二、申请途径</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1. 有志于攻读中国语言文学硕士学位的优秀学生，可主动与导师进行意向沟通，并将个人简历投递至邮箱polo@tju.edu.cn（邮件主题命名为：姓名+院校+专业）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2. 资格审查阶段：导师以教育背景、学业水平、科研能力、综合素质为主要评价依据对申请者进行资格评审。申请结果由导师通知合格入围者，未接到通知的同学皆为未入选者，不再另行通知。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3. 报名复试阶段：通过资格审查学生在教育部推免服务系统报名，参加学院组织的复试。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4. 报名截止时间为2025年8月31日。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/uicQI9FSdwVxBaPicuydruTYNlViaDLRRrbrhbU9qNAXZmQwzBTN71r8ZCtZak7maeBtGMDYRvib51IXf7oHicjrwJA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/PWP4J9p458gToib2VygFg4icQ2jO4TRvyV2yayRwCGzMV7kzx0rGeqnzZR8JZQTlDORmNuOLT4wgAv1IaHNZlTAg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>三、招生导师信息</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iaHKRlJ8zYhwBnBicNRTEFH7NAAiaGxjB4Ay8MyCYy88ibfZucReGz7qQBbnUTficb1wmibqkDyiauxW83NouOVsyv8Gw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/uicQI9FSdwVxBaPicuydruTYNlViaDLRRrbrhbU9qNAXZmQwzBTN71r8ZCtZak7maeBtGMDYRvib51IXf7oHicjrwJA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/PWP4J9p458gToib2VygFg4icQ2jO4TRvyV2yayRwCGzMV7kzx0rGeqnzZR8JZQTlDORmNuOLT4wgAv1IaHNZlTAg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>四、中心介绍</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>天津大学马球文化研究中心（Polo Studies Center at Tianjin University，以下简称“中心”）成立于2024年6月，是天津大学建立的、专注于马球历史、文化和艺术的学术研究机构。中心设有学术组、传播组、业务发展组、艺术创作组等部门，由王婧婵担任执行主任。</span></span></p><p><span><span>中心将在天津大学开设高水平的马球文化、马球运动课程体系，开展系统的资料收集与学术研究，开启广泛的交流合作和传播推广，提升马球运动的社会认知度和影响力。</span></span></p><p><span><span>目前，中心在马球文物相关研究基础之上，进一步完成中国古代马球题材的诗词编撰工作、中国古代马球记载的文献汇编工作，形成中国古代马球文物、诗词和文献三大系列成果，中心还将开展《中国马球》一书的外文翻译工作，向世界传播中国马球历史文化。中心以“小切口”做好“大文章”，将在高校文化建设、前沿创新研究和中外文化交流领域做出积极贡献。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/gzfLiadSibdAYkx4laT47YW5OMyT3QCa8fgBkPZVuibjCcC3aOvHibq9klljsapsVXVpv68Ap9mxiamgB4cqe6gzAGw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"d318ded09cadceb874c285fdfa21e968e47c7ac5800991bf941d26b359bac06a","textLength":1055,"sourceSha256":"2237c323465dc629202afcab37b9a05595976f978a6d8ebef48027d1d27e528d","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-652c14b56ffc1a93699a","title":"2025年天津大学人文艺术学院中国语言文学专业中国古代文学方向 （马球文化研究中心）推免硕士生招生","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:00.031478+00:00"}
